 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "vo01",
   "beat": "hook",
   "text": "Look closely at your skin. Those tiny dots… are pores.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "01.wav",
   "dur": 6.04,
   "sha256": "96f56c6e37b1b037621cfe3e817425127d0829762e0001fbae8112ff2c24505d"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo02",
   "beat": "normal",
   "text": "The pores you can see are little doorways, into narrow tunnels called hair follicles.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "02.wav",
   "dur": 7.58,
   "sha256": "a17540a39e2c25fdba992e550fb0d8d48a64b9f21bb46ca1e4f1b7641a12ba0d"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo03",
   "beat": "change",
   "text": "Even where you can't see one… a fine hair is usually growing inside.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "03.wav",
   "dur": 6.14,
   "sha256": "f41d87c5eb8ce4bbc1ac93297331cab38471a16b8e54fe07da2a2e177a00e0ce"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo04",
   "beat": "why",
   "text": "Partway down sits a small oil gland. Its cells do something strange.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "04.wav",
   "dur": 6.32,
   "sha256": "bc275baaf90b3b18819a4e0e49a5fc3b1a35a396e41e47368719d773634528f2"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo05",
   "beat": "why",
   "text": "Each one slowly fills with oil… until the whole cell breaks down and becomes oil.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "05.wav",
   "dur": 8.04,
   "sha256": "3c50d8a3351b86083188939f5dbf2dc101ccd39f63b7081148dc5bba17baddbd"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo06",
   "beat": "whoa",
   "text": "That oil is called sebum. It glides up along the hair, and spreads over your skin in a thin, soft coat.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "06.wav",
   "dur": 9.38,
   "sha256": "bdd3fb4b50ce07773cbc93675c01d241548f11c694fdc434916b28174315a483"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo07",
   "beat": "whoa",
   "text": "Tiny microbes live in there too, quietly feeding on that oil.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "07.wav",
   "dur": 6.59,
   "sha256": "aceb5ca56776d07d564b1c4d0a31a8565faa9ae56ec3512de9e6d2beeb9ca9be"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo08",
   "beat": "takeaway",
   "text": "That's a pore. A doorway. A hair. A gland. And its tiny residents.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "08.wav",
   "dur": 8.02,
   "sha256": "02d85712c782e2f19b37c61149bba63a7e69e1d7942576fd313d2c3eb4900c9d"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo09",
   "beat": "takeaway",
   "text": "Until… the doorway gets blocked.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "09.wav",
   "dur": 4.39,
   "sha256": "f637dc6d8f39eb3e842ac8b9ccc4912f49727681cba39a30a257dee8d9bc6e93"
  },
  {
   "id": "vo10",
   "beat": "cta",
   "text": "If you're feeling a little calmer, tap like and follow.",
   "stars": [],
   "phonemes": null,
   "file": "10.wav",
   "dur": 4.96,
   "sha256": "3a98d6f2c8eff4ba75d328ac051854376a59bec344e21e4280d80e45299b35b2"
  }
 ]
